(7059106, 1073161, 27812, '<td valign="top">Told you that lens! Fantastic Tibby, you are quite the master of street and night photography. Love your work my brother.<br/> <br/>Tomorrow, for me is scan time again, next week news time. I am tired of the pain/relief, live/die waiting games. And then comes this image and I utterly enjoy exploring every detail. And then I realize, there is so much to live for. You are a pillar in my life!</td>', 'Told you that lens! Fantastic Tibby, you are quite the master of street and night photography. Love your work my brother. Tomorrow, for me is scan time again, next week news time. I am tired of the pain/relief, live/die waiting games. And then comes this image and I utterly enjoy exploring every detail. And then I realize, there is so much to live for. You are a pillar in my life!', '2013-07-02 02:39:16.000000', NULL, 0),
